graph TD
    t_load[Load one Q tile into SRAM] --> t_loop[For each K,V tile]
    t_loop --> t_kv[Load the K,V tile into SRAM]
    t_kv --> t_scores[Block QK scores]
    t_scores --> t_mask[Apply the causal mask<br/>inside the tile]
    t_mask --> t_compute[Online softmax update]
    t_compute --> t_accum[Rescale and accumulate<br/>the output tile]
    t_accum -->|next tile| t_loop
    t_accum -->|after the last tile| t_write[Normalize and write<br/>the tile to HBM]
